Package: LiDAR
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Ligand Propagation and Communication Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Wang Weiqi", email = "wangweiqi6741@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Wang Weiqi [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Wang Weiqi <wangweiqi6741@gmail.com>
Description: Links distance-dependent ligand exposure with transcriptional
    responses to characterize spatial communication. Provides network-based
    response inference, decay fitting, optional reoptimized permutation tests,
    communication scores and visualization. Prior networks are supplied by users.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: methods, Matrix (>= 1.6.1), stats, utils, grDevices, Seurat
        (>= 4.4.0), SeuratObject (>= 4.1.4), CelliD (>= 1.3.1), dnet
        (>= 1.1.7), RANN, igraph, ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0), patchwork
Collate: classes.R helpers.R prepare.R imputation.R networks.R
        response.R propagation.R scores.R aliases.R plots.R globals.R
NeedsCompilation: no
